  "details": "Description\n\nWhen I was in the open beta, I noticed that some worlds, my fps drops from 72fps, to around 40-50fps, and lower with quick menu on. Looking in SteamVR's Advanced Frame Timing shows its a CPU thing. I mostly notice it in the Fish! Game world. This doesn't happen in the regular game branch.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nJoin The Open Beta\n\nLaunch VRChat\n\nGo to Fish! World\n\nWorkarounds:\n\nI am unsure of any other workarounds other than being on the default branch.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Performance\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.2-1951-3ef0ba72ab-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-22_21-16-06.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_316a0977-a654-4167-a237-49970e11717a/1/file)",
